sieve-filter-v1
; The built-in title-v1, written in the token form: whole dictionary words (padding allowed, as
; words-data-v2) within the first max_length characters, then only SPACEs, for a book's title page.
; `within` makes it count on its own, as title-v1 does: it is not one automaton over the whole page.
id        title-data
version   1
author    Edward James Gordon (written with Claude)
origin    ai-directed
lines     text
symbols   lower27
describe  A title: whole dictionary words within the first max_length characters, then only SPACEs (title-v1, as a plugin).
param     dictionary  dict  default  the word list (a registered dictionary)
param     max_length  int  64  1  1000000  longest title, in characters

tokens    separator " "
edges     whole
padding   trailing
within    max_length
set       word  dict:{dictionary}
end
